cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use The Stats Duck in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "The Stats Duck: A statistical computing toolkit for DuckDB"
abstract: >-
  The Stats Duck is an open-source DuckDB extension that adds statistical
  computing to SQL: descriptive statistics, hypothesis tests, distribution
  functions, grammar-of-graphics visualization (VISUALIZE), and readers and
  writers for SAS, SPSS, and Stata files. Computations are implemented as
  streaming aggregates and scalar functions so they scale to billion-row
  datasets and also run in DuckDB-WASM in the browser.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Meneghello
    given-names: Massimo
repository-code: "https://github.com/KoliStat/the-stats-duck"
url: "https://github.com/KoliStat/the-stats-duck"
version: 0.8.0-nothing
date-released: "2026-08-06"
license: Apache-2.0
